{"timestamp": "2026-09-22T06:23:53.934962+00:00", "task_id": "4421171136024435bb7e6b851f45bbf6", "event": "observation_received", "data": {"tool": "read_file", "success": true, "content": {"path": ".continue/rules/jinja2flask-product-gallery-standards.md", "total_lines": 46, "content": "---\nglobs: \"**/templates/upload_video/product_lists.html,**/includes/product_lists_\\\n  upload.py,**/routers/upload_video/index.py\"\ndescription: Use when working with upload_video product_lists template, gallery,\n  or product_lists_upload.\n---\n\n## Product Gallery (product_lists.html)\n\n### File locations:\n- Python logic: `includes/product_lists_upload.py`\n- Route: `routers/upload_video/index.py` → `/upload_video/product_lists` (POST)\n- Template: `templates/upload_video/product_lists.html`\n\n### Data structure from `open_product_lists()`:\nEach item in the list has: `index` (int 1-based), `folder` (full path str), `image` (full path to product/1.jpg), `exists` (bool), `product_id` (str from upload_schedule.json folders[].product_id), `title` (str from schedule.json product.title), `url` (str from schedule.json product.url)\n\n### Template rules:\n1. Uses `truncate_title(title, max_chars=50)` macro — truncates to 50 chars + \"...\"\n2. Thumbnail links to `/product/{{ item.product_id }}` (NOT to image URL), only when `item.exists and item.product_id`\n3. Title links to `item.url` (Tokopedia URL) with `target=\"_blank\"`\n4. Badge index: position absolute top-left, circle shape, bg black, border/text cyan (#00f2ff)\n5. Cards use flexbox with `d-flex flex-fill` for equal height\n6. No full path displayed — only image, badge, and title\n7. Grid: `row-cols-2 row-cols-md-3 row-cols-lg-4 row-cols-xl-5`\n8. Image: height=220px, object-fit=cover\n9. Title: max 3 lines with `-webkit-line-clamp: 3`\n\n### Jinja2 logic (DO NOT CHANGE):\n```jinja2\n{% if item.exists and item.product_id %}\n<a href=\"/product/{{ item.product_id }}\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"{{ url_for('upload_video.product_image', path=item.image) }}\" ...>\n</a>\n{% elif item.exists %}\n<img class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"{{ url_for('upload_video.product_image', path=item.image) }}\" ...>\n{% else %}\n<div class=\"card-img-top placeholder-img ...\"> ... </div>\n{% endif %}\n\n{% if item.url and item.title %}\n<a href=\"{{ item.url ...[truncated]"}}}
